                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1369] If the EVCC selected the service parameter MobilityNeedsMode set to 2 and EVCC receives a AC_ChargeLoopRes message with DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, and if the EVCC cannot accept this DepartureTime, TargetSOC or MinimumSOC, e.g. for internal reasons, then the EVCC shall send different values in a AC_ChargeLoopReq than the values in AC_ChargeLoopRes within the number of seconds stated in AckMaxDelay of AC_ChargeLoopRes.",
            "block_bbox": [
                135,
                1135,
                1123,
                1292
