            "block_content": "[V2G20-1210] If the charging session is subject to metering and an AbsolutePriceSchedule with power specific pricing rules has been selected, then the SECC shall provide the EVSEPresentActivePower[_L2,_L3] measurements during the charging process. The values shall reflect the same quantities which are used by the SECC to determine the pricing.",
